.SH NAME
std::ranges::concat_view::iterator::operator[] \- std::ranges::concat_view::iterator::operator[]

.SH Synopsis
constexpr decltype(auto) operator[]( difference_type pos ) const  (since C++26)
requires /*concat-is-random-access*/<Const, Views...>;

Returns a reference to an element at specified relative location.

.SH Parameters

pos - position relative to current location

.SH Return value

*((*this) + pos)

